[{"id":183011388,"discussion_id":"e787eb18b5a08a8c46f0771d65d8c74f69568a75","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 RMS Norm 算子在 Ascend 设备上的 `int32_t` 整数溢出问题。当处理大张量时，`blockIdx_ * blockFactor * numCol` 等地址偏移计算可能超出 `int32_t` 的表示范围，导致数组越界或数据错误。修复方案是将这些乘法表达式中的操作数通过 `static_cast<uint64_t>` 提升为 64 位无符号整数，并将相关函数参数（`gm_bias`、`progress`）的类型从 `uint32_t` 改为 `uint64_t`，从而避免溢出。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **全局内存地址偏移量计算提升至 64 位**: 在 `rms_norm_merge_n.h`、`rms_norm_single_row.h`、`rms_norm_whole_reduce_sum.h` 中，`xGm`、`yGm`、`rstdGm` 的 `SetGlobalBuffer` 调用中涉及 `blockIdx_ * blockFactor * numCol` 的乘法，均对 `blockIdx_` 和 `rowWork` 添加了 `static_cast<uint64_t>` 转换，防止 `int32_t` 乘法溢出。\n- **`CopyIn` 函数签名参数类型变更**: 在 `rms_norm_merge_n.h` 和 `rms_norm_single_row.h` 中，`CopyIn` 方法的 `gm_bias` 参数类型从 `uint32_t` 改为 `uint64_t`，以确保偏移量能正确传递 64 位地址。\n- **`CopyOutY` 和 `ComputeSingleRow` 函数签名参数类型变更**: `rms_norm_merge_n.h` 中 `CopyOutY` 的 `progress` 参数和 `ComputeSingleRow` 的 `gm_bias` 参数从 `uint32_t` 改为 `uint64_t`；`rms_norm_single_row.h` 中 `CopyOutY` 的 `progress` 参数同样提升为 `uint64_t`。\n- **局部变量 `gmBias` 类型提升**: 在 `rms_norm_single_row.h` 的 `ComputeOuterLoop` 中，局部变量 `gmBias` 的计算通过 `static_cast<uint64_t>(indexOuter)` 提升后与 `rowFactor`、`numCol` 相乘，类型改为 `uint64_t`。\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-03T20:56:18+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-03T21:06:25+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":183011390,"discussion_id":"66a29ced89568963c799c7271713bb16e16ca289","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查总结\n\n对三个变更文件逐一审查完毕：\n\n- **`norm/rms_norm/op_kernel/rms_norm_merge_n.h`**：发现 1 个问题（P2），详见上方报告。该文件对 `CopyIn`、`ComputeSingleRow`、`CopyOutY` 及 GM 地址计算的 `uint64_t` 提升是正确的，但 `Compute` 函数的 `elementNum` 参数遗漏未改，与本次溢出修复的范围不一致。\n- **`norm/rms_norm/op_kernel/rms_norm_single_row.h`**：未发现问题。所有 GM 地址计算均正确添加了 `static_cast<uint64_t>()`，`CopyIn` 和 `CopyOutY` 参数类型已同步提升为 `uint64_t`，`gmBias` 的计算也正确处理了 64 位提升。\n- **`norm/rms_norm/op_kernel/rms_norm_whole_reduce_sum.h`**：未发现问题。GM 地址偏移计算添加了 `static_cast<uint64_t>()`，且由于该类中 `num_col` 本身已是 `uint64_t`，size 参数的乘法天然安全。\n\n### 各优先级发现数\n\n| 优先级 | 数量 |\n|--------|------|\n| P0     | 0    |\n| P1     | 0    |\n| P2     | 1    |\n| P3     | 0    |\n\n### 整体风险判断\n\n本次变更主体正确，针对 `blockIdx_ * blockFactor * numCol` 这类 GM 地址偏移溢出的修复到位。但 `merge_n.h` 中 `Compute` 函数遗漏了 `elementNum` 参数的类型提升，存在部分路径的溢出修复不完整，**中低风险**，建议在上线前补齐该遗漏。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 0 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 1 |\n\n\uD83D\uDCAC 仅评论\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-03T20:56:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-03T21:37:43+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":183011428,"discussion_id":"0fedd6dc1ea700f274e68fe1f187d782adf565d5","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| 9.1.0 | ✅ [*Andy-lb*](https://gitcode.com/Andy-lb), [*陈昊文*](https://gitcode.com/Chen_HaoWen) (2/2) | ✅ [*Andy-lb*](https://gitcode.com/Andy-lb) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)","created_at":"2026-08-03T20:56:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-13T16:27:29+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":183011429,"discussion_id":"46924f4b23a0ba935a38457df58b11575d1c3b57","body":"## CLA Signature Pass  \n liuyun_nj, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-08-03T20:56:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-03T20:56:29+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":183011517,"discussion_id":"18e32c1f5bc4e6e26283332ff642859ce1389352","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-08-03T20:56:49+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-03T20:56:49+08:00","user":{"id":"6822d8eae4b985165b4b0cf2","login":"liuyun_nj","object_id":"6822d8eae4b985165b4b0cf2","name":"liuyun_nj","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liuyun_nj"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":183012113,"discussion_id":"09feab155e9f72c035323cce1b4320f2e47b8b62","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=e20b2243ac00439b99de79a5acd5d580&projectName=CANN'>e20b2243ac00439b99de79a5acd5d580</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_gui