    <td><strong>codecheck_precommit</strong></td>\n                        <td>⚠️ WARNING</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=669b4d37f09c4c088c393fdbf0f50b93&pipelineRunId=6df5d6ef4dd14c9285f15270f2127449&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-nn/package/8217/pre-commit.txt>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>SCA</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/personalScandTaskInfor/person/450a4dcf-a70e-48c4-b4e4-6474b4823b48?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-08-03 21:00:57] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-08-03T21:00:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-03T21:00:57+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":183018962,"discussion_id":"6a6888a7a78fa5e106c436f4d79e6ac8c381a697","body":"\uD83D\uDFE1 **Medium Priority**\n\n本次 PR 将 `merge_n.h` 中 `CopyIn`、`ComputeSingleRow`、`CopyOutY` 的 GM 偏移参数从 `uint32_t` 提升为 `uint64_t`，以防止 `blockIdx_ * blockFactor * numCol` 等表达式溢出。但 `DoMainCompute`（第 103 行）中 `elementNum` 已用 `uint64_t` 计算：\n\nuint64_t elementNum = static_cast<uint64_t>(calcRowNum) * static_cast<uint64_t>(numColAlign);\n\n而它调用的 `Compute` 函数（第 233 行）仍声明为 `uint32_t elementNum`：\n\n__aicore__ inline void Compute(uint32_t i_o, LocalTensor<float> gammaLocal, uint32_t calcRowNum, uint32_t elementNum)\n\n这导致第 108 行 `Compute(i_o, gammaLocal, calcRowNum, elementNum)` 发生隐式收窄：`uint64_t` → `uint32_t`。当 `rowFactor * numColAlign > UINT32_MAX` 时（NPU 64GB 显存下可达），`elementNum` 的高位被截断，`Compute` 内部对 `Mul`/`Cast` 等操作使用错误的数量，产生静默数据错误。该问题与 PR 修了同类函数（`CopyIn`/`CopyOutY`）但遗漏 `Compute` 的模式不一致。\n\n**建议**：将 `Compute` 函数的 `elementNum` 参数类型从 `uint32_t` 改为 `uint64_t`，与调用方 `DoMainCompute` 中 `elementNum` 的 `uint64_t` 类型保持一致。同时检查 `Compute` 内部所有使用 `elementNum` 的 Ascend C API 是否支持 `uint64_t`，如不支持可添加显式收窄并在调用处做上限检查。","created_at":"2026-08-03T21:37:45+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-13T15:35:29+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"6822d8eae4b985165b4b0cf2","login":"liuyun_nj","object_id":"6822d8eae4b985165b4b0cf2","name":"liuyun_nj","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liuyun_nj"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":233,"end_new_line":233,"start_old_line":231,"end_old_line":231,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":183033776,"discussion_id":"eab3d67be5f2a01b78aa6b3320ebbdf89b072205","body":"/approve","created_at":"2026-08-04T00:15:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-04T00:15:36+08:00","user":{"id":"68b14ec355aaf21f7ae618e0","login":"Chen_HaoWen","object_id":"68b14ec355aaf21f7ae618e0","name":"Chen_HaoWen","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Chen_HaoWen"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":183033786,"discussion_id":"9680f2b89fb44cac692f08f56a4d2245d3dc86eb","body":"The following users do not have permission to comment `/lgtm` or `/approve` on any module in this PR:\n[*陈昊文*](https://gitcode.com/Chen_HaoWen)","created_at":"2026-08-04T00:15:42+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-04T00:15:42+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcod